    <item>
      <title>rocketmq 事务消息</title>
      <link>https://zzkrix.com/posts/rocketmq-tx/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 12:30:46 +0000</pubDate><author>zzkrix56@gmail.com (zzkrix)</author>
      <guid>https://zzkrix.com/posts/rocketmq-tx/</guid>
      <category domain="https://zzkrix.com/categories/%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97/">消息队列</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;参考：&lt;a href=&#34;https://rocketmq.apache.org/zh/docs/featureBehavior/04transactionmessage/&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://rocketmq.apache.org/zh/docs/featureBehavior/04transactionmessage/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lightgallery&#34; href=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&#34; title=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&#34; data-thumbnail=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&#34; data-sub-html=&#34;&lt;h2&gt;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&lt;/h2&gt;&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&#39; alt=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514113814225.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;简单讲，业务上的事务包含（数据库事务 + 消息事务），原先生产者只能控制数据库事务的提交或回滚，RocketMQ 使用消息确认的机制将这两者进行了关联，大致代码执行逻辑为：&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>本地消息表</title>
      <link>https://zzkrix.com/posts/rocketmq-message-cache/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2023 09:02:01 +0000</pubDate><author>zzkrix56@gmail.com (zzkrix)</author>
      <guid>https://zzkrix.com/posts/rocketmq-message-cache/</guid>
      <category domain="https://zzkrix.com/categories/%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E9%98%9F%E5%88%97/">消息队列</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;参考：&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.tizi365.com/question/4832.html&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://www.tizi365.com/question/4832.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cnblogs.com/FlyAway2013/p/10124283.html&#34;target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://www.cnblogs.com/FlyAway2013/p/10124283.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lightgallery&#34; href=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&#34; title=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&#34; data-thumbnail=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&#34; data-sub-html=&#34;&lt;h2&gt;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&lt;/h2&gt;&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&#39; alt=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514090939232.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;lightgallery&#34; href=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&#34; title=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&#34; data-thumbnail=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&#34; data-sub-html=&#34;&lt;h2&gt;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&lt;/h2&gt;&#34;&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&#39; alt=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zzkrix/blog-images/main/assets/image-20230514093611903.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;简单的讲，就是生产方需要多维护一个已发送消息的数据表（与业务表在一个库，方便执行业务事务），发送完 MQ 消息后等待消费方回调后再更新本地消息表。&lt;/p&gt;</description>
